      en: ["The center offers over 50 different retail and service outlets.", "It features a modern multiplex cinema in the upper section.", "The glass facade was designed to reduce energy costs via natural daylight.", "It is located at the corner of Joshua Nkomo Street and 9th Avenue.", "The complex also includes secure parking facilities for customers.", "The Bulawayo Centre is regarded as one of the city's most exclusive shopping locations."],
