      en: ["The building was originally commissioned as a post office in 1895.", "It served as the seat of the Legislative Council of Southern Rhodesia from 1899.", "The Parliament of Zimbabwe met here until the year 2023.", "The facade is a prominent example of colonial Victorian architecture.", "It is located directly opposite Africa Unity Square.", "The building houses a gallery featuring portraits of former Speakers of Parliament."],
